{"id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetization-formula.md","title":"Arithmetization of Formula","display":"df-arithmetization-formula — Arithmetization of Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetization-formula","aliases":["92-df-arithmetization-formula"],"display":"df-arithmetization-formula — Arithmetization of Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetization-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetization-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetization-formula — Arithmetization of Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate formula code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FmlCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FmlCode}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{FmlCode}_G(n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{FmlCode}_G(n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;(n=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公式的算术化：将每个公式编码为唯一自然数</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FmlCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FmlCode}_G\\)</span> 是固定 Gödel 编码下公式码的范围谓词，不是任意编号下都自动成立的有效性结论</li>\n<li>对本书已固定的符号码、素数幂序列码和有效公式文法，编码、合法性检验及合法码上的解码都可由有界搜索与结构递归实现为原始递归操作</li>\n<li>若更换编码，上述有效性性质必须重新证明，而不能仅从单射性推出</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","s